  "purpose": "Pinned, hash-verified inputs for the ADR-2080 model-router console. ONE source of truth: flake.nix reads this file to bake /opt/agentbox/model-router (rebuild class) and scripts/model-router-fetch.sh reads it to populate the pre-rebuild fallback dir $WORKSPACE/.agentbox/model-router. Never edit hashes by hand \u2014 re-pin with a new upstream ref and recompute.",
